{"id":"402030929107","publishedAt":1795315236000,"posts":[[{"size":10,"color":"#008000","text":"ネット"},{"br":1},{"size":18,"text":"『GTA6』発売初日に37億9000万ドル（約6000億円超）を売り上げ、ゲーム以外も含めたエンターテインメント業界史上最大のローンチに\n"},{"size":18,"text":"https://t.co/TuVy5W1CIq"},{"size":18,"text":"\n\n事前予約分だけで3250万本を販売。数字が化け物すぎて目を疑うレベル "},{"size":18,"text":"https://t.co/ScVXclkZ9M"},{"br":1},{"size":18,"text":"— ファミ通.com (@famitsu) "},{"size":18,"href":"https://x.com/famitsu/status/2123886453805691127?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw","text":"November 20, 2026"},{"br":1},{"size":18,"href":"https://x.com/famitsu/status/2123886453805691127","text":"https://x.com/famitsu/status/2123886453805691127"},{"br":1},{"size":18,"text":"『GTA6』映画含むエンタメの王者に―発売初日で売上37億9,000万ドルを達成！発売前販売本数も3,250万本を記録\n"},{"size":18,"text":"https://t.co/JDDScpqoly"},{"size":18,"text":"\n\n日本円にして約6,010億円。Metacriticでも99点を獲得。あらゆる記録を塗り替える歴史的なスタート "},{"size":18,"text":"https://t.co/vDfXF2QQJL"},{"br":1},{"size":18,"text":"— ⚡Game*Spark⚡ (@gamespark) "},{"size":18,"href":"https://x.com/gamespark/status/2123864398385312096?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw","text":"November 20, 2026"},{"br":1},{"size":18,"href":"https://x.com/gamespark/status/2123864398385312096","text":"https://x.com/gamespark/status/2123864398385312096"},{"br":1},{"size":10,"color":"#008000","text":"クリア"},{"br":1},{"size":18,"color":"#FF9999","text":"\n【驚愕】名作『GTA6』の売上本数が凄すぎる！！！！\n"},{"br":1},{"size":18,"color":"#004466","text":"\n■すごい！\n"}]],"comments":[]}